      "content": "This is much better. The integration of those brands actually helps ground the trends in reality. I can see how you're using Saint Laurent and Bottega Veneta to illustrate the points.\n\nThe ranking engine just flagged this draft again, though. The score is still a bit on the low side for a lead feature, and since this is going to be our main seasonal outlook, we really need it to hit a certain threshold to catch the algorithm.\n\nCan you take this and flesh it out into a full-length report? Try to be even more exhaustive in your analysis of the different houses. I'm still stressing: please don't make it a list or just repeat names for the sake of it—it has to stay professional and insightful—but we definitely need more brand context throughout the entire piece to get that score up where it needs to be.",
